GOFEE/AGOX vs recommended GFN2-xTB water hexamer at 4000 counted
force evaluations, ten seeds (Elja array 1777730).

- calls_w6_s{0-9}.dat  -- GOFEE/AGOX true-call ledger (energy per call)
- rec4k_w6_{0-9}.log   -- recommended cluster_search summary
- rec4k_w6_{0-9}.min   -- recommended accepted-minima dumps
- gofee_w6_s{0-9}.xyz  -- deepest structure in each AGOX database
  (Elja run4k_w6_{seed}/db_w6_s{seed}.db)

Recommended deepest / median / spread in the manuscript come from
the .log best lines, not from the first line of each .min dump.
GOFEE deepest / median / spread come from min(energy) of each
calls file. GOFEE isomers are O--O contacts at 3.2 Angstrom on
gofee_w6_s*.xyz (4 ring, 3 cage, 1 prism, 2 other).
